---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy of Crestworks Consulting GmbH — GDPR compliant.">
  <Nav />
  <main class="main">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Last updated: 2026-08-06</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Controller</h2>
        <p>
          Crestworks Consulting GmbH<br />
          Claude-Dornier-Str. 401<br />
          82234 Weßling, Germany<br />
          E-Mail: <a href="mailto:hello@crestworks.co">hello@crestworks.co</a><br />
          Phone: +49 (0) 170 4797 183
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Data collected when visiting this website</h2>
        <p>
          When you visit this website, our server automatically collects certain technical data
          transmitted by your browser: IP address, date and time of access, pages visited, browser
          type and version, operating system, and referrer URL. This data is processed on the basis
          of Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR (legitimate interest) to ensure the security and stability
          of our web infrastructure. Log files are deleted after 30 days.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Contact via e-mail</h2>
        <p>
          If you contact us via e-mail, the data you provide (name, e-mail address, message content)
          will be stored and used solely to process your inquiry and for potential follow-up questions.
          Legal basis: Art. 6 para. 1 lit. b GDPR (performance of a contract or pre-contractual steps)
          or Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR (legitimate interest). Data will not be passed on to third
          parties without your consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Hosting &amp; third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          This website is hosted as a static site via GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr.
          Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA). When you access our site, GitHub may process your
          IP address for infrastructure and security purposes. Please refer to GitHub's privacy policy
          at <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">docs.github.com</a>
          for further information.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use Google Fonts for typography. Font files are loaded from Google's servers; Google may
          process your IP address in doing so. Legal basis: Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR (legitimate
          interest in a consistent visual presentation). See Google's privacy policy at
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Your rights under GDPR</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Request access to your personal data (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request rectification of inaccurate data (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request erasure of your data (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Object to processing (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority (e.g. Bayerisches Landesamt für
              Datenschutzaufsicht, Promenade 18, 91522 Ansbach, Germany)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise your rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@crestworks.co">hello@crestworks.co</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this privacy policy to reflect changes in our practices or applicable law.
          The current version is always available at this URL.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .main { padding-top: 8rem; padding-bottom: 6rem; min-height: 80vh; }
  .container { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: .5rem;
  }
  .subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: .75rem; padding-bottom: .5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  p { color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  ul { color: var(--text-muted); margin: .5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  li { margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  a:hover { opacity: .75; }
</style>
